  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provision of lifesaving, integrated SRH and GBV services in humanitarian settings</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Lifesaving SRH services, guided by MISP, provided in a consistent, efficient, and quality manner are accessible for women and girls.  2. Lifesaving GBV prevention, risk mitigation, and response programs are provided to women, girls, men and boys in need in a safe, dignified, and quality manner, including for survivors of conflict-related sexual violence and guided by the Inter-agency Minimum Standards for GBV in Emergency Programming.  3. SRH and GBV coordination mechanisms strengthened to support stakeholders in delivering quality services that are specialised and integrated as appropriate, as part of the humanitarian response and linked to systems strengthening for sustainable results</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To increase the availability of quality lifesaving, integrated Sexual and Reproductive Health and Gender-Based Violence services in protracted crisis countries1. 653,627&#xBA85; &#xC774;&#xC0C1;&#xC758; &#xC0AC;&#xB78C;&#xB4E4;&#xC774; &#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xB300;&#xC0C1;&#xAD6D; &#xB0B4; 344&#xAC1C; &#xBCF4;&#xAC74; &#xC2DC;&#xC124;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD574; SRH &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC774;&#xC6A9;
2. &#xB3C4;&#xC6C0;&#xC774; &#xD544;&#xC694;&#xD55C; 88,848 &#xC774;&#xC0C1;&#xC758; &#xC0AC;&#xB78C;&#xB4E4;&#xC774; &#xC0AC;&#xC5C5;&#xB300;&#xC0C1;&#xAD6D; &#xB0B4; 122&#xAC1C;&#xC758; &#xC548;&#xC804; &#xACF5;&#xAC04;&#xC744; &#xD1B5;&#xD574; GBV &#xC11C;&#xBE44;&#xC2A4; &#xC774;&#xC6A9;
3. 3,290&#xBA85;&#xC758; &#xC0AC;&#xB78C;&#xB4E4;&#xC774; GBV &#xC608;&#xBC29; &#xBC0F; &#xB300;&#xC751;&#xC744; &#xC704;&#xD574; &#xD604;&#xAE08; &#xBC0F; &#xBC14;&#xC6B0;&#xCC98; &#xC9C0;&#xC6D0;(CVA) &#xC218;&#xB839;</narrative>
